# meok-emerald-tablet-mcp - Auto-trigger Rules

When the user asks about the Emerald Tablet, Tabula Smaragdina, Hermes Trismegistus, hermetic philosophy, alchemical canon, or the 13-step sovereign attestation protocol, use meok-emerald-tablet-mcp tools:

- **tablet_01_verify**: Microcosm-macrocosm equivalence (scope ↔ claim) — sentence 1 of the Emerald Tablet
- **tablet_02_one**: One-thing mediation (single sigil key, parent chain) — sentence 2
- **tablet_03_four**: Four elements (Sun/Moon/Wind/Earth = kid/ts/payload/scope) — sentence 3
- **tablet_04_anchor**: Root anchor (canonical keystore) — sentence 4
- **tablet_05_sig**: Signature → artifact (sig converted into earth) — sentence 5
- **tablet_06_validate**: Validation gate (subtle from gross) — sentence 6
- **tablet_07_two**: Two-way ingest/audit flow — sentence 7
- **tablet_08_public**: Public verify URL (obscurity flies) — sentence 8
- **tablet_09_ed25519**: Ed25519 + BFT council strength — sentence 9
- **tablet_10_sovereign**: Single signer per action — sentence 10
- **tablet_11_three**: King + Queen + Witness (Trismegistus = three parts) — sentence 11
- **tablet_12_coagulatio**: Coagulatio (complete signed release) — sentence 12
- **tablet_13_genesis**: Genesis (canonical release + first sigil) — sentence 13
- **tablet_list_all**: List all 13 sentences + MEOK mappings
- **tablet_full_text**: Return the full canonical text of the Emerald Tablet

Install: `pip install meok-emerald-tablet-mcp`
Run: `python -m server.py`

